; Exceptions replaced. excl's fn and excx's k, the item (17 cards: its end card, n, and its run with an edge on each
; side), and the record of the exceptions' phonemes for k (12 cards, 10 x code + stress, padded with 0) in; out an
; item of 17 cards: an exception as -20, 0 and its phonemes (stress 0 for a function word), then 0s; another word as
; -22 (a function word) or -21 and its letters, for the rules; anything else as it was.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   fn       03-11: an exception, or not
  04                    INP   k
  05                    INP   end
  06                    CLA   k
  07                    SUB   00
  08                    TAC   word
  09                    CLA   n15
  10                    STO   i
  11            skip    INP   x        11-38: an exception: the item passed over, the phonemes out
  12                    CLA   i
  13                    SUB   00
  14                    STO   i
  15                    TAC   ph
  16                    JMP   skip
  17            ph      OUT   m20
  18                    OUT   z
  19                    CLA   n11
  20                    STO   i
  21            pl      INP   x
  22                    CLA   fn
  23                    SUB   00
  24                    TAC   po
  25                    CLA   x
  26                    SFT   01
  27                    SFT   10
  28                    STO   x
  29            po      OUT   x
  30                    CLA   i
  31                    SUB   00
  32                    STO   i
  33                    TAC   zs
  34                    JMP   pl
  35            zs      OUT   z
  36                    OUT   z
  37                    OUT   z
  38                    JMP   rec
  39            word    CLA   end      38-56: a word for the rules, or anything else: the item, the record passed over
  40                    ADD   n10
  41                    TAC   copy
  42                    SUB   00
  43                    TAC   rul
  44                    JMP   copy
  45            rul     CLA   m21
  46                    SUB   fn
  47                    STO   end
  48            copy    OUT   end
  49                    CLA   n15
  50                    STO   i
  51            cp      INP   x
  52                    OUT   x
  53                    CLA   i
  54                    SUB   00
  55                    STO   i
  56                    TAC   drop
  57                    JMP   cp
  58            drop    CLA   n11
  59                    STO   i
  60            dl      INP   x
  61                    CLA   i
  62                    SUB   00
  63                    STO   i
  64                    TAC   rec
  65                    JMP   dl
  70            fn      DATA  0
  71            k       DATA  0
  72            end     DATA  0
  73            x       DATA  0
  74            i       DATA  0
  75            z       DATA  0
  76            n15     DATA  15
  77            n11     DATA  11
  78            n10     DATA  10
  79            m21     DATA  -21
  80            m20     DATA  -20
